                <pb facs="0952" n="850" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.00/826: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Vice Consul at Port Limon</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Montgomery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José</hi> [<hi rendition="#small-caps">Port
                            Limon</hi>]</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-12T17:00:00-05:36"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                                1919, 5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            August 16, 12.48 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Tinoco and party of 26 men, women and children sailed from here at three this
                    afternoon for Kingston on steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Zacapa.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Montgomery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
